+SteamCreateServer.cpp - the Create Server window of the Steam version (CreateMultiplayerGameDialog of GameUI) and the
+Advanced window of the Multiplayer options (MultiplayerAdvancedDialog), both lists of the cvars of a script
+
+This program is free software: you can redistribute it and/or modify
